{"4317160":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Starlight Farm","steam_appid":4317160,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start with a patch of soil<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow seeds, water your crops, and bring home the harvest. Sell your produce, buy supplies, and plan what to grow next as the seasons change.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/c11a2e5863f5a44792b866193a507f7e.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/c11a2e5863f5a44792b866193a507f7e.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little star makes a harvest special<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crops come in Normal, Silver, Gold, and Purple Star qualities. Keep harvesting each crop to unlock rarer qualities, then record your prized specimens in the crop guide.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/86ac1c288c66cafbdeb231439efb9419.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/86ac1c288c66cafbdeb231439efb9419.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow into better tools<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way from wooden tools to Purple Gold equipment. Explore the forest and mine, gather materials, and visit the smithy to prepare for your next day on the farm.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/ef977652abcf696695664ea9c9575231.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/ef977652abcf696695664ea9c9575231.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to know the valley<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the villagers, listen to their stories, and help with their commissions. Between harvests, follow the paths beyond your farm and find your place in this small pixel world.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/68626dfcdba88bc6b7c9044020cf1414.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/68626dfcdba88bc6b7c9044020cf1414.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start with a patch of soil<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow seeds, water your crops, and bring home the harvest. Sell your produce, buy supplies, and plan what to grow next as the seasons change.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/c11a2e5863f5a44792b866193a507f7e.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/c11a2e5863f5a44792b866193a507f7e.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little star makes a harvest special<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crops come in Normal, Silver, Gold, and Purple Star qualities. Keep harvesting each crop to unlock rarer qualities, then record your prized specimens in the crop guide.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/86ac1c288c66cafbdeb231439efb9419.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/86ac1c288c66cafbdeb231439efb9419.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow into better tools<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way from wooden tools to Purple Gold equipment. Explore the forest and mine, gather materials, and visit the smithy to prepare for your next day on the farm.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/ef977652abcf696695664ea9c9575231.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/ef977652abcf696695664ea9c9575231.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to know the valley<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the villagers, listen to their stories, and help with their commissions. Between harvests, follow the paths beyond your farm and find your place in this small pixel world.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras\/68626dfcdba88bc6b7c9044020cf1414.avif?t=1793093816\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/extras_big\/68626dfcdba88bc6b7c9044020cf1414.webp?t=1793093816 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span>","short_description":"Build your pixel farm: sow seeds, tend crops, unlock rare qualities, and turn harvests into better tools. Explore the valley and meet its villagers through stories and commissions. Text available in Simplified Chinese, English, Russian, and Korean.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian, Korean<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/1e15e27612e8c57e816bb798acc145a7356dfbdd\/header.jpg?t=1793093816","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4317160\/4b97003c5cd1223fc10b